%
% This version is a temporary hack to have proper \lccode/\uccode set in
% LuaTeX Plain- and LaTeX-based formats in TL, while waiting for a more
% proper/general LuaTeX-specific framework for handling Unicode properties.
% The modification are indicated by comments starting with 'MPG'.
%
% This modified version is hand-crafted by Manuel PÃ©gouriÃ©-Gonnard.
% The original file is generated by a Perl script and shipped with XeTeX.
% This version can be freely used, distributed and modified as far as
